<title>HONG KONG: First Shanghai 1996 net loss HK$13.9 mln.</title>
<headline>First Shanghai 1996 net loss HK$13.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.09 loss  vs 4.52 loss (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    13.88 loss vs 17.37 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     147.30     vs 73.35</p>
<p>    Company name		 First Shanghai Investments Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - First Shanghai is engaged in share investments and stockbroking, general insurance, finance, deposit-taking and banking services.</p>
<p>Comparative loss per share has been adjusted taking into account the dilution effect of the rights issue of the company in November, 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
